{"t_ms": 10758218, "conversation_id": "conv_immediate_s2_050", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Medical Assistance & First Aid\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nBasic first aid assistance is available at the Front Desk at all times. In case of medical emergencies, the hotel can arrange immediate transportation to the nearest hospital or contact an on-call doctor. Guests requiring regular medication or special medical support are advised to inform the hotel during check-in for appropriate assistance.", "Printing & Photocopy Services\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nPrinting, scanning, and photocopying services are available through the Business Centre. Guests may email their documents to the Business Centre or use the available workstations. Standard printing charges apply, while basic scanning services are provided free of charge for registered hotel guests.", "Reception & Concierge Services\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe Front Desk operates 24 hours a day to assist guests with check-in, check-out, travel information, and general inquiries. Concierge services include restaurant reservations, local sightseeing recommendations, transportation arrangements, wake-up calls, and assistance with special guest requests. Staff members are available at all times to provide prompt support and ensure a comfortable stay."], "scores": [0.7450190782546997, 0.8929226398468018, 0.9107622504234314], "filenames": ["50_medical_assistance.txt", "46_printing_services.txt", "05_reception_services.txt"], "timing_policy": "immediate", "timing_trigger": "immediate", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 297, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
